{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]She stood alone in the dust and [Eb]sand
[Gm]The crowd had gone, leaving her in [Eb]hand
[Gm]Jesus straightened [F]up to see her [Eb]face
In the qui[Gm]et place [F]where silence [Eb]traces
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
