{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]Neither do I [F]condemn you [Gm]now
[Eb]Go from this [F]place, make the light [Gm]your vow
[Eb]Sin no [F]more, turn from the [Gm]old way
[Eb]Walk in the day, let the [F]shadows fade a[Eb]way [F]
